#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:12
msgid "Data handled by the extension"
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:14
msgid ""
"Quick Add reads the active shop page only after you click its toolbar button "
"and grant access to that shop. It extracts candidate product titles, URLs, "
"images, prices, currencies, and product metadata."
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:17
msgid ""
"Extraction and review happen locally in Firefox. Product information is sent "
"to nosCadeaux only after you click “Add to my list.” Pages that you scan but "
"do not add are not sent to nosCadeaux."
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:20
msgid "Account connection"
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:22
msgid ""
"The extension uses an authorization code and a scoped access token to "
"connect to your nosCadeaux account. It never receives or stores your "
"password. The token is stored in Firefox extension storage; the server "
"stores only its cryptographic hash."
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:25
msgid "Purpose and retention"
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:27
msgid ""
"Submitted product information is stored as a gift in your nosCadeaux account "
"and remains there until you edit or delete it. You can revoke the extension "
"token with the Disconnect button. Temporary authorization codes expire after "
"five minutes and cannot be reused."
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:30
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:32
msgid ""
"Quick Add does not sell product or browsing data and does not use it for "
"advertising. Product data is shared through nosCadeaux only according to the "
"gift-list and group visibility settings you select."
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:35
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr ""

#: gifts/templates/gifts/extension_privacy.html:37
msgid ""
"Access to shop pages is requested one shop at a time. You can review or "
"revoke these permissions in Firefox’s Add-ons Manager. Disconnecting removes "
"the extension’s local account token and revokes it on the nosCadeaux server "
"when reachable."
msgstr ""

